# Line endings are normalised to LF everywhere in this repository.
#
# Rationale: this repository is documentation and Linux-targeted scripts. LF is what
# GitHub renders, what the lab machines expect, and what every editor in use here
# handles without complaint. Fixing the ending explicitly removes the conversion
# warnings that appear when the default (convert to CRLF on Windows checkout) is left
# in place.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows targets — these must keep CRLF
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# Binary — never converted
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
